@startuml token_issue
title Issue opaque token and store ABAC claims

actor User
participant "API" as Api
database SQLite

User -> Api : POST /api/oauth/token\ngrant_type=password\nclaims.topics[A=write, B=read]\nclaims.provider[W=run, contingent]

Api -> SQLite : SELECT users
Api -> Api : verifyPassword(argon2id)

loop each topic claim
  Api -> SQLite : content_client_authorizations\nuser + studio, status=granted
  alt missing grant or write>read cap
    Api --> User : 403
  end
end

Api -> SQLite : provider_client_authorizations\nuser + wallet W
alt second wallet requested
  Api --> User : 400 only one provider claim
end

Api -> SQLite : INSERT oauth_tokens access\n(token_hash, grants_json=claims)
Api -> SQLite : INSERT oauth_tokens refresh\n(same claims)
Api --> User : 200 {\n  access_token: opaque,\n  refresh_token,\n  claims\n}

note over User, SQLite
  The Bearer does not contain claims.
  GET /api/oauth/tokeninfo and
  POST /api/oauth/introspect load grants_json.
end note

@enduml
